    "text": "By K8 Newsdesk ,\n8 hours ago CLAY COUNTY, Ark. (KAIT) - A 23-year-old Poplar Bluff man died Monday night after his car ran off a Clay County highway and struck several trees. Arkansas State Police reported the crash happened at 10:33 p.m. Aug. 10 on US 67 North at the intersection of Clay County Road 154. Read full article\n2",
